add(TYW2,'Trade Your Way to Financial Freedom — alternate scan','Book',['psychology','money-management','rule-based'], 'A second scan of the same named work, not an additional independently established book. The random-entry passage matches the 1999 copy substantively, but the files have different hashes and PDF pagination. Its exact edition or printing has not been established from the reviewed pages.', 'partial_rules','Van K. Tharp',None,[(tyr2,[[1,1]],'Contents and named work reviewed; exact edition not certified.'),(tyr2,[[111,111]],'The random-entry passage matches the other scan: ten-day exponential volatility and a three-volatility one-way close trail.')],[('Alternate source copy','Preserve the scan as a separate file and do not inflate the distinct-book count.')],[random10], 'Only the named contents and matching random-entry passage were compared. Different byte identity does not prove a different edition. See the primary 1999 copy for the checked copyright.')
